From 8cab392d783669976554f2ec4bc57ce0e4515dae Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Pavan S <psreenivas@habana.ai>
Date: Thu, 16 Dec 2021 05:42:25 +0200
Subject: [PATCH] [SW-0] gaudi2: use gaudi2_security header file

This patch reuses the structures and macros defined
in gaudi2_security.h header file defined in specs

Signed-off-by: Pavan S <psreenivas@habana.ai>
Change-Id: Ie595b411df6213827ca5cad5ec3c99a12aa94536
---

diff --git a/arch/gaudi2/common/security.c b/arch/gaudi2/common/security.c
